// Compatibility redirect for the old article slug.
//
// This article was retitled and re-slugged from "Good Agent Context Is Carved,
// Not Copied" to "Better Agent Results Start With Better Context". The old URL
// had been linked from the homepage and external sources, so keep it working.
//
// GitHub Pages cannot serve real HTTP 301 redirects, so Astro renders this as
// a static meta-refresh document that:
//   - auto-redirects visitors to the new URL
//   - carries robots="noindex, follow" so search engines do not index the alias
//   - declares the canonical to the destination
//   - offers a direct fallback link for clients without meta-refresh support
return Astro.redirect('/blog/better-agent-results-start-with-better-context/', 301);
---